• All five needles now non-zero; `--restricted present 6× in docs/src/`
• cargo fmt --check, clippy --all-targets -D warnings, build, test — all green
• cargo test --test module_size → **28 passed, zero warnings**, so this morning's register payment stays paid
• git status --porcelain → exactly the two in-scope files; no `src/` touched, since the Rust half was already evaluated PASS

